Project headers are stored here.

- config.h: CPU, I2C, and UART clock settings.
- i2c.h: bounded AVR TWI register-transfer interface.
- rtc.h: DS1307/DS3231 clock interface and status values.
- time_utils.h: host-testable BCD, hour-mode, and input parsing helpers.
- uart.h and utils.h: serial I/O and clock display.

Application sources include the headers they need. No external Arduino library is required.
